{"seq":3,"slug":"price-lock-demand-aggregation","title":"锁单价保与需求聚合（联 142 C2M）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/presale-model/price-lock-demand-aggregation","wordCount":2421,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"锁单价保与需求聚合-联-142-c2m\">锁单价保与需求聚合（联 142 C2M）</h1><p>用户愿意提前几个月付钱，换来的通常不是更早拿到货，而是<strong>一个更低、更确定的价格</strong>。商家愿意接受这个约束，换来的是<strong>一份可生产批次的需求承诺</strong>。这一篇讲这两个交换条件各自怎么实现：锁单价保是把商家的调价风险通过预付款冻结，需求聚合是把散点订单拼成一条产线的最小起订量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>锁定价格与聚合需求看似是两件事，实际上是同一个机制的两种读法。用户看到的&quot;锁价&quot;是商家对未来市场行情的对冲承诺；商家看到的&quot;聚合&quot;是用户可以接受更长等待期换来的折扣。两者共用一个数值基础——<strong>聚合需求量</strong>。</p>\n<p>设单品售价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，产线的最小起订量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，单位生产成本随批量递减。若预售累计预定量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q &lt; Q_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，商家要么亏本开线，要么取消项目（回到 <a href=\"../crowdfunding-goal-risk/stretch-goal-threshold-refund\">众筹的达标判定</a>）。需求聚合的全部工程意义就是<strong>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 尽早、尽量准确地推过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q\\_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[详情页展示锁价价] --&gt; B[用户付定金]&#10;    B --&gt; C[定金池累计量 Q]&#10;    C --&gt; D{Q &gt;= Q_min?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[继续聚合&lt;br/&gt;展示进度条]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[触发开线]&#10;    F --&gt; G[价格锁定至交付]&#10;    C --&gt; H{聚合窗口到期?}&#10;    H --&gt;|仍未达| I[取消并全额退款]&#10;    G --&gt; J[按订单优先级排产]\">graph TD\n    A[详情页展示锁价价] --&gt; B[用户付定金]\n    B --&gt; C[定金池累计量 Q]\n    C --&gt; D{Q &gt;= Q_min?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[继续聚合&lt;br/&gt;展示进度条]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[触发开线]\n    F --&gt; G[价格锁定至交付]\n    C --&gt; H{聚合窗口到期?}\n    H --&gt;|仍未达| I[取消并全额退款]\n    G --&gt; J[按订单优先级排产]</pre><h2 id=\"锁价的定价结构与风险承担\">锁价的定价结构与风险承担</h2><h3 id=\"锁价不是折扣-是一份期权\">锁价不是折扣，是一份期权</h3><p>用户付定金锁定价格，本质上是买入了一份<strong>看涨期权</strong>：如果交付时市场价上涨，用户受益；如果下跌，用户仍按锁定价支付，损失由用户承担。商家卖出这份期权，得到的补偿是早期的现金流与确定性需求。</p>\n<p>这个视角解释了锁价条款里三条必备约定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>锁价的有效期</strong>：必须明确到具体日期或事件（如&quot;至发货日&quot;），否则&quot;锁价&quot;在系统里无法判定何时比较价格。</li>\n<li><strong>价格比较的基准</strong>：市场价由谁定义？通常是商家自己的挂牌价，但要注意各国对&quot;降价宣传&quot;的规则——欧盟通过 Omnibus 指令修订了《价格标示指令》，要求任何降价宣传都必须标示此前的价格，且该此前价格被定义为<strong>降价前 30 天内商家所适用的最低价格</strong>。这意味着&quot;先涨价再锁价，宣称省了 500 元&quot;的做法在多国是违规的（规则要点见欧盟消费者权益说明 <a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/consumers/shopping/guarantees-returns/index_en.htm\">https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/consumers/shopping/guarantees-returns/index_en.htm</a> ）。</li>\n<li><strong>涨价与降价的差额归属</strong>：交付时若实际售价低于锁定价，是否补差？多数平台不补差，但必须在条款中写明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"锁价的账务表达\">锁价的账务表达</h3><p>锁价产生的差额在会计上是一笔或有负债，在系统里应当被显式记录，否则无法评估一次预售的真实毛利。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE presale_price_lock (&#10;  lock_id          BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id         BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES presale_order(order_id),&#10;  sku              TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  locked_unit_price NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  market_price_at_lock NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency         CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  lock_expires_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  released_at      TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  release_reason   TEXT,&#10;  UNIQUE (order_id, sku)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_price_lock_expiry&#10;  ON presale_price_lock (lock_expires_at)&#10;  WHERE released_at IS NULL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> presale_price_lock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lock_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_order(order_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  locked_unit_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market_price_at_lock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lock_expires_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  released_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  release_reason   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, sku)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_price_lock_expiry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_price_lock (lock_expires_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> released_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>部分索引 <code>WHERE released_at IS NULL</code> 让&quot;找出所有仍然有效的锁价&quot;这个高频查询只扫描未释放的行——锁价表在长周期预售里会积累大量已释放记录，全表索引的维护成本会随时间线性上升。</p>\n<h3 id=\"汇率与多币种的锁价\">汇率与多币种的锁价</h3><p>跨境场景下&quot;锁价&quot;必须同时锁住两个量：商品本币价格与结算汇率。只锁商品价格不锁汇率，用户支付时的本币金额仍会随汇率波动。工程上通常的做法是锁定<strong>用户币种下的应付总额</strong>，本币差额由商家承担并计入汇兑损益。这要求订单上同时保存三个值：本币挂牌价、下单时汇率、用户币种应付额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"需求聚合的机制\">需求聚合的机制</h2><h3 id=\"聚合窗口与进度可视化\">聚合窗口与进度可视化</h3><p>聚合窗口是一个有开始与结束的时间区间。用 ISO 8601 的区间表示法可以无歧义地表达它——该标准规定时间区间可用&quot;起点/终点&quot;的形式书写，例如 <code>2007-03-01T13:00:00Z/2008-05-11T15:30:00Z</code>，也可用起点加时长 <code>P14D</code> 的形式（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601</a> ）。对本例而言即 <code>2026-10-01T00:00:00Z/2026-10-15T23:59:59Z</code>。用结构化格式而非自由文本存储窗口，能让&quot;窗口是否已结束&quot;成为一个可索引、可比较的谓词。</p>\n<p>进度可视化是聚合模式的转化引擎：把&quot;已预订 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> / 目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&quot;实时展示，利用社会认同推动下单。它的工程要点是<strong>读多写少与一致性</strong>——进度条会被高频读取，而写入是每笔定金一次。用缓存展示近似值、用真实值做达标判定，是标准做法；反过来（用缓存做判定）会导致达标判定错误。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[定金写入] --&gt; B[(定金明细表)]&#10;    B --&gt; C[增量更新聚合计数]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Redis 展示计数]&#10;    B --&gt; E[达标判定&lt;br/&gt;读明细表聚合]&#10;    D --&gt; F[前端进度条]&#10;    E --&gt; G{达到 Q_min}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[开线事件]\">graph LR\n    A[定金写入] --&gt; B[(定金明细表)]\n    B --&gt; C[增量更新聚合计数]\n    C --&gt; D[Redis 展示计数]\n    B --&gt; E[达标判定&lt;br/&gt;读明细表聚合]\n    D --&gt; F[前端进度条]\n    E --&gt; G{达到 Q_min}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[开线事件]</pre><h3 id=\"达标判定的正确数据源\">达标判定的正确数据源</h3><p>达标判定必须读<strong>权威明细</strong>而不是缓存计数。缓存可能因过期、淘汰、重建而丢失增量，用它做资金决策会让项目在&quot;展示已达标&quot;和&quot;实际未达标&quot;之间摇摆。正确的做法是让达标判定走一个幂等的聚合查询，并在判定完成后写一个不可变的 <code>goal_reached</code> 事件作为下游（开线、通知、排产）的唯一触发源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO presale_goal_event (campaign_id, event_type, qty_at_decision, decided_at)&#10;SELECT&#10;  c.campaign_id,&#10;  &#39;GOAL_REACHED&#39;,&#10;  COALESCE(SUM(o.qty), 0),&#10;  now()&#10;FROM presale_campaign c&#10;LEFT JOIN presale_order o&#10;  ON o.campaign_id = c.campaign_id&#10; AND o.status IN (&#39;DEPOSIT_PAID&#39;, &#39;TAIL_PAID&#39;)&#10;WHERE c.campaign_id = $1&#10;GROUP BY c.campaign_id, c.goal_qty&#10;HAVING COALESCE(SUM(o.qty), 0) &gt;= c.goal_qty&#10;ON CONFLICT (campaign_id, event_type) DO NOTHING;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_goal_event (campaign_id, event_type, qty_at_decision, decided_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'GOAL_REACHED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_campaign c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_order o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DEPOSIT_PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TAIL_PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">goal_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">goal_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (campaign_id, event_type) DO NOTHING;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING</code> 让这个判定可以安全地被重复执行——这是把幂等性放在数据库层而非应用层的典型用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"c2m-联动-从聚合量到产线指令\">C2M 联动：从聚合量到产线指令</h2><p>需求聚合的下一步是反向驱动生产，即 C2M（customer-to-manufacturer）。这一步引入了一个新约束：<strong>产线的最小起订量与换线成本</strong>。同一台设备切换不同规格会产生换线时间，因此最优排产不是&quot;按订单顺序生产&quot;，而是&quot;按规格聚类、按批量排序&quot;。</p>\n<p>工程上的关键是把聚合量与产线参数分开建模：聚合量是需求的输出，产线参数是产能的输入，两者的结合点是一个排产计划。把产线参数写死在业务代码里，会导致换一个供应商就要改代码。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>归属</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>聚合需求量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>需求侧</td>\n<td>由定金明细实时聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小起订量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>产能侧</td>\n<td>供应商合同约定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换线时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>产能侧</td>\n<td>同设备切换规格的固定损耗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位工时</td>\n<td>产能侧</td>\n<td>随批量递减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交付承诺日</td>\n<td>两者结合</td>\n<td>由排产计划推导，见 <a href=\"../presale-order-inventory/production-leadtime-delivery-promise\">ATP</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分批开线的触发器\">分批开线的触发器</h3><p>当聚合量超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之后，新的问题是要不要<strong>继续聚合</strong>。多聚合一段时间可以拿到更好的批量单价，但会推迟交付，增加弃付风险。这是一个可以用期望值判断的决策：设继续聚合带来的单位成本下降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，推迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 天导致的弃付增量期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta r(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则继续聚合的条件是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q \\cdot \\Delta c &gt; Q \\cdot P \\cdot \\Delta r(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两侧的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 可以约掉，得到一个与规模无关的判断：<strong>单位成本的相对降幅要大于弃付率的增量</strong>。这个结论对工程的含义是，分批开线的决策参数（成本曲线与弃付曲线）应当被集中管理且可观测，而不是埋在一个硬编码的阈值里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锁价与聚合的冲突处理\">锁价与聚合的冲突处理</h2><p>两者在一种情况下直接冲突：<strong>用户锁价后又想取消</strong>。如果取消发生在聚合未达标时，处理很简单——一起退款。但如果取消发生在开线之后，商家已经为这个数量投入了产能，此时退款会让商家承担沉没成本，而法律上（见 <a href=\"deposit-refundability-regulation\">定金可退性</a>）多数司法辖区仍要求退还。</p>\n<p>可行的处理是把这个冲突在<strong>产品设计阶段</strong>消解，而不是靠条款硬扛：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>把&quot;开线后不可退&quot;改成&quot;开线后退款需扣除已发生的定制成本&quot;，并证明该成本真实存在（对应定制商品例外）。</li>\n<li>或者在开线前设置一个&quot;最终确认&quot;节点，让用户在知道确切交付日后再次确认。</li>\n<li>或者对聚合模式采用&quot;达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才真正扣款&quot;的授权冻结结构，未达标的退款就是释放授权。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>第三种做法在工程上最干净，因为它把&quot;钱还没真正离开用户&quot;变成事实而非承诺，代价是前面提到的授权有效期限制——卡组织对未捕获授权的有效期通常只有 5 到 7 天（见 <a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/payments/place-a-hold-on-a-payment-method\">https://docs.stripe.com/payments/place-a-hold-on-a-payment-method</a> ），长周期聚合无法靠单次授权覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>锁价本质是商家卖出的一份看涨期权，必须约定有效期、比较基准与差额归属。</li>\n<li>欧盟要求降价宣传标示降价前 30 天内的最低价，&quot;先涨后锁&quot;的玩法在多国违规。</li>\n<li>锁价表应使用部分索引只维护未释放记录，避免长周期预售下的索引膨胀。</li>\n<li>多币种锁价必须同时锁定用户币种应付额，本币差额计入汇兑损益。</li>\n<li>聚合窗口用结构化区间（ISO 8601）存储，&quot;窗口是否结束&quot;才可作为谓词判定。</li>\n<li>进度展示可读缓存，达标判定必须读权威明细，并把判定结果写成唯一的下游事件。</li>\n<li>分批开线与否取决于单位成本相对降幅与弃付率增量的大小关系。</li>\n<li>定制成本例外只有在该成本真实存在时才成立，不能作为规避退款权的通用借口。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>聚合未达标时的退款语义见 <a href=\"../crowdfunding-goal-risk/stretch-goal-threshold-refund\">达标/stretch goal/未达标退款</a>；弃付率的度量与预测见 <a href=\"../presale-ops-metric/presale-conversion-deposit-tail\">预售转化、定金转化与弃尾款</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"锁单价保与需求聚合（联 142 C2M）","id":"锁单价保与需求聚合-联-142-c2m"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"锁价的定价结构与风险承担","id":"锁价的定价结构与风险承担"},{"level":3,"text":"锁价不是折扣，是一份期权","id":"锁价不是折扣-是一份期权"},{"level":3,"text":"锁价的账务表达","id":"锁价的账务表达"},{"level":3,"text":"汇率与多币种的锁价","id":"汇率与多币种的锁价"},{"level":2,"text":"需求聚合的机制","id":"需求聚合的机制"},{"level":3,"text":"聚合窗口与进度可视化","id":"聚合窗口与进度可视化"},{"level":3,"text":"达标判定的正确数据源","id":"达标判定的正确数据源"},{"level":2,"text":"C2M 联动：从聚合量到产线指令","id":"c2m-联动-从聚合量到产线指令"},{"level":3,"text":"分批开线的触发器","id":"分批开线的触发器"},{"level":2,"text":"锁价与聚合的冲突处理","id":"锁价与聚合的冲突处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"定金可退性与预付消费法规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/presale-model/deposit-refundability-regulation"},"next":{"title":"预售/现货库存隔离与预留","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/presale-order-inventory/presale-inventory-separation-allocation"}}